cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this table, cite it -- and cite the source_url of each row you quote."
type: dataset
title: "YouTube RPM, CPM and brand CPV by niche and year (youtube-cpm)"
abstract: >-
  A hand-maintained fact table of YouTube creator earnings rates: our own niche RPM
  index by year (triangulated privately against sources we may not republish), creators' own
  disclosed YouTube Studio numbers, and yearly macro series (YouTube ad revenue,
  partner-programme size, advertiser CPM, ad CTR). One row per claim, each with its
  own source link and date. It records who said what, when. It is not ground truth.
authors:
  - name: "q3dresearch"
    website: "https://github.com/q3dresearch"
keywords:
  - youtube
  - rpm
  - cpm
  - creator-economy
  - dataset
